<title>HONG KONG: Seoulbank mandates US$100 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Seoulbank mandates US$100 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seoulbank has mandated SBC Warburg to arrange a US$100 million floating rate note issue, sources close to the transaction said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>They said the facility has a final maturity of three years with no put or call options.</p>
<p>The issue will be priced at par to float at 44.5 basis points over the six-month London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>With fees, the all-in return for top-tier managers is 49 basis points.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
